{"id": 2110, "updated": "2026-10-14", "episodes": [{"n": 1, "t": "— You will be mine, Hero. — I refuse!", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26308/sub"}}, {"n": 2, "t": "Please Make Us Human.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26309/sub"}}, {"n": 3, "t": "Where have you been?", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26310/sub"}}, {"n": 4, "t": "If That Happens, I&#39;ll Take a Bite Out of the Hero!", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26311/sub"}}, {"n": 5, "t": "You smell good, Demon King. And I feel safe in your arms, Hero.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26312/sub"}}, {"n": 6, "t": "—Welcome back, Hero! —Yeah, Old Man. I&#39;m back!", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26313/sub"}}, {"n": 7, "t": "—I&#39;ll be back soon, we&#39;ll see each other soon.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26314/sub"}}, {"n": 8, "t": "Take this sword, my lord", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26315/sub"}}, {"n": 9, "t": "I Am Human", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26316/sub"}}, {"n": 10, "t": "So now their plans are finally coming to fruition?", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26317/sub"}}, {"n": 11, "t": "I just destroy and kill, without creating anything", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26318/sub"}}, {"n": 12, "t": "—I&#39;m back, my Hero. —You sleep too much, my Demon King.", "e": {"sub": "https://megaplay.buzz/stream/s-2/26319/sub"}}]}